---
---
<section class="section section--light" id="produtos">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Produtos</span>
      <h2>A Calculadora de IR mais completa do Brasil.</h2>
      <p>Cálculo, DARF e Declaração de Imposto de Renda — para investimentos no Brasil e no Exterior.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="products">
      <article class="product-card">
        <div class="product-card__illo cf-dots">
          <div class="product-card__tile">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/><line x1="3" y1="20" x2="21" y2="20"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="product-card__flagchip"><span class="fl">🇧🇷</span> Bolsa de Valores · B3</div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card__body">
          <h3>IR para a Bolsa de Valores</h3>
          <p>Apuração mensal simples, rápida e segura para ações, FIIs, ETFs, opções e day trade — feita em apenas 3 passos.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Importação automática de notas SINACOR
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Conferência de custódia com a B3
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Geração de DARF com juros e multas
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Relatório de auxílio à declaração anual
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" class="product-cta" id="product-b3-btn">
            Conhecer o produto
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="product-card">
        <div class="product-card__illo cf-dots">
          <div class="product-card__tile product-card__tile--green">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="product-card__flagchip"><span class="fl">🇺🇸</span> Investimentos no Exterior</div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card__body">
          <h3>IR para Exterior</h3>
          <p>Cálculo do imposto sobre investimentos fora do Brasil — feito de forma precisa e segura, com suporte às principais corretoras internacionais.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Conversão automática de câmbio (PTAX)
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Cálculo conforme nova Lei 14.754/23
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Compatível com Avenue, Nomad, IBKR e mais
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
              Relatórios exclusivos de acompanhamento
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" class="product-cta" id="product-exterior-btn">
            Conhecer o produto
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('product-b3-btn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
    window.posthog?.capture('product_learn_more_clicked', { product_name: 'IR para a Bolsa de Valores' });
  });
  document.getElementById('product-exterior-btn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
    window.posthog?.capture('product_learn_more_clicked', { product_name: 'IR para Exterior' });
  });
</script>
